# LeakSanitizer suppressions for Peek's preview tests (test-only).
#
# Qt 6.11.2 does not release a shown QVideoWidget's backing store before
# LSan's exit-time check on the offscreen platform. Proven Peek-independent:
# a bare shown QVideoWidget with no QMediaPlayer and no Peek code leaks
# identically (~1 MiB, same QVideoWindow::event -> QBackingStore stacks),
# while a hidden QVideoWidget and a standalone QMediaPlayer are leak-clean.
# Peek deletes every object it creates (player stopped, source cleared,
# widgets parented); all suppressed stacks are Qt-internal with no Peek
# frames, so Peek-owned leaks still fail the gate.
leak:QVideoWindow::event
